  "mainEntity": {
    "name": "What Affects the Cost of a Second-Story Addition in San Diego?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of a Second-Story Addition in San Diego?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The cost of a second-story addition depends on the size and complexity of the new level, the existing home’s structural capacity, the extent of interior remodeling, design and engineering needs, materials, site access, utility changes, and permit requirements. A reliable estimate requires project-specific plans and a review of how the addition connects to the existing house.",
